{
  "name": "fairgive-expense-reports",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Fairgive Expense Reports: checks staff expense report lines against your policy settings: missing receipts, meals over the per diem, mileage over the rate, alcohol and other unallowable costs charged to grants, duplicate claims and late submissions. Never pays or approves.",
